YA ALI KARBALA ME AAG LAGI<br>
<br>
Ya Ali Karbala me aag lagi,<br>
Qanaye Mustafa me aag lagi.<br>
<br>
Jal rahi hai Rasool ki masnad,<br>
Qalbe Qairunnisa me aag lagi.<br>
<br>
Sar barehna hai dil jali Zainab,<br>
Chadare Fatima me aag lagi.<br>
<br>
Jal raha hai kisi ka pairahan,<br>
Aur kisi ki rida me aag lagi.<br>
<br>
Roke kehti hai Saniye Zehra,<br>
Utho Abid aba me aag lagi.<br>
<br>
Karbala se jo shaam me pohunche,<br>
Qalbe Zainulleba me aag lagi.<br>
<br>
Dekho aakar najaf se Ainullah,<br>
Kaisi ye nainawa me aag lagi.<br>
<br>
Yaad kar Fatima ka dar 'Hilmi',<br>
Dekh ab Karbala me aag lagi...